  m_Name: SSO_Log_SK_Time
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  Header: Hidden Message 3
  Body: "To hell with what they may think. I\u2019ll remind you that when construction
    is finished, we\u2019re finished. The Chosen will be escorted to the roof and
    it\u2019ll be sealed off while we rot in here forever.\r\n\r\nI\u2019m as nervous
    as you are about this whole thing\u2026 but if we hope to even have a chance
    of surviving, we must act NOW.\r\n\r\nYours, K."
